  "content": "[Intro]\n[Db5]\n[Db5]\n\n[Verse 1]\nI saw the vir-\ngin's cunt\nspawning forth the\nsnake\nI witnessed\ntribes ov Judah re-\nduced to ruin\nI watched disci-\nples twelve dis-\nsolved by flame\nLooked down on\nson ov god\nsnuffed in\nvain\n\n[Bridge]\n[Db5]\n\n[Verse 2]\n[Db5]Blow your trum-\npets\nGabriel!\nAs I beheld\nthe be-\nwilderment ov E-\nden\nBreak the bread...\nand\ncrumb by crumb into Le-\nviathan's den...\nNations fall\nprey\nHail my return\n\n[Break]\n[E5](Hail, hail,\n[F5]hail, [Ab5]hail)\n[Db5]\n\n[Verse 3]\n[Db5]Hosanna\n[F5]Tribe ov Judah\ndecimate [E5]\n[Db5]Hosanna\n[F5]Root ov David e-\nradicate [E5]\n\n[Solo]\n[Db5]\n\n[Verse 4]\n[Db5]Hosanna\nLet\n[F5]wine ov Sodom\nfill our mouths [E5]\n[Db5]Hosanna\nMay\n[F5]Sin ov Gommorah\ngrace [E5]our\n\n[Outro]\n[Bm]hearts\n[F#m]\n[Gmaj7]\n[Bm]\n[Bm]\n[F#m]\n[Gmaj7]\n[Bm]\n[Bm]\n[F#m]\n[Gmaj7]\n[Bm]\n[Bm]\n[F#m]\n[Gmaj7]\n[Bm]\n[Bm]\n[F#m]\n[Gmaj7]\n[Bm]\n[Bm]\n[F#m]\n[Gmaj7]\n[Bm]\n[Bm]\n[F#m]\n[Gmaj7]\n[Bm]\n[Bm]\n[F#m]\n[Gmaj7]\n[Bm]\n[Bm]",
